    "status": "present",
    "value": "Build a calendar that accepts events one at a time. Each event is a half-open time interval [startTime, endTime). An event may be added only if it shares no moment with any event already accepted; touching end-to-start is fine. book(startTime, endTime) adds the event and returns true if it fits, and otherwise leaves the calendar unchanged and returns false."
  },
